`opentelemetry-sdk`: remove deprecated `LoggingHandler` and the `OTEL_PYTHON_LOGGING_AUTO_INSTRUMENTATION_ENABLED` variable. For automatic standard library log export, install `opentelemetry-instrumentation-logging` and unset the old variable. Remove the deprecated `LogExportResult`, `LogExporter`, `ConsoleLogExporter`, `InMemoryLogExporter`, `LogLimits`, and `LogDroppedAttributesWarning` aliases.
